  "description": "Yeon Hae-Geum, the nation’s one and only S-Class Guide, has been in love for years with Seo Moon-Hyeon - his guardian, mentor, and the man who raised him like family. From teaching him how to eat and read to mastering his guiding abilities, Moon-Hyeon has always been Hae-Geum’s everything. But just when Hae-Geum thinks he'll stay by his side forever, Moon-Hyeon suddenly announces his engagement… without even telling him. Crushed, Hae-Geum prepares to walk away... that is until fate throws in a twist: Seo Moon-Hyeok, Moon-Hyeon’s identical twin brother, shows up. Cold, blunt, and endlessly flirtatious, Moon-Hyeok needs Hae-Geum—not for love, but to power his climb to the top. Still, he’s not above using his twin’s face to seduce him. Now trapped between a possessive first love and a reckless new temptation, Hae-Geum must navigate a storm of emotions, pheromones, and dangerous attraction.\n\nWill he remain loyal to the past—or give in to the thrill of something forbidden? One face, two destinies. One guide, caught in between.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
